Report only issues that this patch introduces; pre-existing problems in code the patch does not change do not count. `file` is a path relative to the repository root and `line` is a line number in the new version of that file, after the patch. Use the category that fits the issue and name the rule it breaks when one does.
Repository signals only; verdicts driven by findings are in the table above.
